&lt;p&gt;&lt;blockquote class=&quot;twitter-tweet&quot;&gt;&lt;p lang=&quot;en&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;Holy shit it took me way too long to figure out what this is &lt;a href=&quot;https://t.co/u8Z40W0y3h&quot;&gt;pic.twitter.com/u8Z40W0y3h&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&amp;mdash; tiffany fong (retarded) (@TiffanyxFong) &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/TiffanyxFong/status/2086854821672546411?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw&quot;&gt;August 10, 2026&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt; &lt;script async src=&quot;https://platform.x.com/widgets.js&quot; charset=&quot;utf-8&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
